-- after the confinement: too late
#ASSERT `Under section 76(1)(b), do the 12 weeks I agreed with my employer begin inside the 28 days before my confinement or on the day of it` (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 11 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 28 days before the confinement: the earliest day
#ASSERT `Under section 76(1)(c)(i), do the 8 weeks I agreed with my employer begin inside the 28 days before my confinement or on the day of it` (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 13 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 29 days before: too early
#ASSERT `Under section 76(1)(c)(i), do the 8 weeks I agreed with my employer begin inside the 28 days before my confinement or on the day of it` (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 12 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day of the confinement: the latest day
#ASSERT `Under section 76(1)(c)(i), do the 8 weeks I agreed with my employer begin inside the 28 days before my confinement or on the day of it` (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 10 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- after the confinement: too late
#ASSERT `Under section 76(1)(c)(i), do the 8 weeks I agreed with my employer begin inside the 28 days before my confinement or on the day of it` (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 11 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
