#ASSERT `Under section 121(1), must each of us with the same claim against our employer make a separate claim` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under section 123, may I divide my claim into several claims so that each comes within the Commissioner's jurisdiction` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 123, may I divide my claim into several claims so that each comes within the Commissioner's jurisdiction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

