#ASSERT `Under section 126, must I pay court fees at the start of proceedings against my employer` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 126A(a) and s 126D(2) (Part 15A)
#ASSERT `Under section 126A(a), is my employer's failure to keep records, give me a record of key terms, or give me pay slips a civil contravention` `ea3 Yes` `ea3 No` `ea3 No` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 126A(a), is my employer's failure to keep records, give me a record of key terms, or give me pay slips a civil contravention` `ea3 No` `ea3 No` `ea3 No` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not sure about the records, and the other two are no: yes if the records were not kept, no if they were.
