-- The failure to give key terms alone makes it a civil contravention, whatever the records.
#ASSERT `Under section 126A(a), is my employer's failure to keep records, give me a record of key terms, or give me pay slips a civil contravention` `ea3 I am not sure` `ea3 Yes` `ea3 No` EQUALS JUST TRUE
